### Create a Collection

The extent sent here is replaced as soon as items are added: the API recomputes
`extent.spatial` and `extent.temporal` from the collection's items.

```elixir
collection_data = %{
  "id" => "my-test-collection",
  "title" => "My Test Collection",
  "description" => "A collection for testing",
  "license" => "CC-BY-4.0",
  "catalog_id" => "my-test-catalog",
  "stac_version" => "1.0.0",
  "extent" => %{
    "spatial" => %{"bbox" => [[-180, -90, 180, 90]]},
    "temporal" => %{"interval" => [["2024-01-01T00:00:00Z", "2024-12-31T23:59:59Z"]]}
  }
}

{:ok, response} = Req.post(manage_req, url: "/collections", json: collection_data)

IO.puts("Status: #{response.status}")
response.body
```

